This is not an open-source licence. It grants a few specific permissions and
reserves everything else. Where it is silent, the answer is no — ask.


1. PLAY IT

Download LethalBreed and use it: on your own machine, on a server you run, with
whoever you like, for as long as you like. Nothing in this licence restricts
playing the mod, and nothing in it ever will.


2. SHARE IT — UNMODIFIED, AND FREE

You may pass the mod on as you received it, provided all of the following hold:

  a. you distribute it unmodified, with this licence file alongside it;
  b. you credit Dreyka Oas as the author and link to
     https://lethalbreed.pages.dev;
  c. you charge nothing and earn nothing from it — see section 3.


3. DO NOT SELL IT

You may not sell the mod, nor profit from access to it. That covers selling it
outright, bundling it into anything sold, and placing it behind a paywall,
subscription, early access, mandatory donation, advertising, link shortener or
any comparable scheme.

Being paid for a service that happens to run the mod — a game server, for
instance — is fine. What is paid for must be the service, not the mod.


4. ASK FIRST FOR ANYTHING ELSE

Written permission from Dreyka Oas is required, in advance, before you:

  - modify the mod, or publish a modified build or a fork;
  - reuse its source code, in whole or in part, in another project;
  - publish it as part of a modpack;
  - use its name, branding or assets for anything beyond crediting it.

Ask through the project's GitHub issue tracker. Permission is granted case by
case, in writing, and covers only what it names.


5. PERMISSION CAN BE WITHDRAWN

Any permission granted under section 2 or section 4 may be withdrawn by Dreyka
Oas at any time — in particular where the use misrepresents the mod, breaches
the terms above, or ties the mod to content its author does not wish it tied to.

On written notice, stop distributing within 30 days. Copies already installed
by players are unaffected: nobody ever loses the right to keep playing.


6. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The distributed jar bundles third-party libraries that carry their own licences.
Those licences govern those files, not this one. See THIRD-PARTY.md.


7. NO WARRANTY

The mod is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied.
Dreyka Oas is not liable for any claim, damage or other liability arising from
the mod or from its use.
